### [206. 反转链表](https://leetcode.cn/problems/reverse-linked-list/)
```java
class Solution {
    public ListNode reverseList(ListNode head) {
        if(head == null)
            return null;
        ListNode cur = head;
        ListNode pre = null;
        while(cur != null){
            ListNode node = cur.next;
            cur.next = pre;
            pre = cur;
            cur = node;
        }
        // 返回前一个节点
        return pre;
    }
}
