**分成含该节点  与    不含该节点**
向左树、右树要信息
```java
class Solution {
    class Info{
        int height;
        int length;
        Info(int h, int l){
            height = h;
            length = l;
        }
    }
    public int diameterOfBinaryTree(TreeNode root) {
        return process(root).length;
    }
    public Info process(TreeNode root){
        if(root == null)
            return new Info(0, 0);
        Info leftInfo = process(root.left);
        Info rightInfo = process(root.right);
        int height = Math.max(leftInfo.height, rightInfo.height) + 1;    
        // 不要该节点   要该节点
        int length = Math.max(Math.max(leftInfo.length, rightInfo.length), leftInfo.height+rightInfo.height);
        return new Info(height, length);
    }
}
```
### [124. 二叉树中的最大路径和](https://leetcode.cn/problems/binary-tree-maximum-path-sum/)
**当前节点最优解  ≠  返回给父节点的信息**
返回值：从当前节点出发  ，向下延伸的一条**单链路径**
最优解：真正的全局最优路径
```java
class Solution {
    int length = Integer.MIN_VALUE;
    public int maxPathSum(TreeNode root) {
        process(root);
        return length;
    }
    public int process(TreeNode root){
        if(root == null){
            return 0;
        }
        // 避免负数
        int left = Math.max(0, process(root.left));
        int right = Math.max(0, process(root.right));
        length = Math.max(length, left+right+root.val);
        // 头结点+包含的单链路径
        return root.val + Math.max(left, right);
    }
}
```
### 最大快乐值与 [337. 打家劫舍 III](https://leetcode.cn/problems/house-robber-iii/)
![算法笔记配图](/image/algorithms/pasted-image-20260608100824.png)

| 当前状态       | 子树策略        |                                                             |
| ---------- | ----------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |
| rob（偷）     | 子树必须 notRob | left.no + right.no + root.val                               |
| notRob（不偷） | 子树自由选择 max  | Math.max(left.yes, left.no) + Math.max(right.yes, right.no) |

```java
class Solution {
    class Info{
        int yes;
        int no;
        Info(int yes, int no){
            this.yes = yes;
            this.no = no;
        }
    }
    public int rob(TreeNode root) {
        return Math.max(process(root).yes, process(root).no);
    }
    public Info process(TreeNode root){
        if(root == null)
            return new Info(0, 0);
        Info left = process(root.left);
        Info right = process(root.right);
        int yes = left.no + right.no + root.val;
        int no = Math.max(left.yes, left.no) + Math.max(right.yes, right.no);
        return new Info(yes, no);
    }
}
```
### [968. 监控二叉树](https://leetcode.cn/problems/binary-tree-cameras/)
```java
class Solution {
    class Info{
        // 当前节点有相机，子节点状态无所谓
        int a;
        // 当前节点无相机但被覆盖，左右子节点必须有一个有相机
        int b;
        // 当前节点无相机且未被覆盖
        // 因为自底向上执行
        // 只有a状态可以保证这个情况
        // 叶子节点可以不放
        int c;
        Info(int a, int b, int c){
            this.a = a;
            this.b = b;
            this.c = c;
        }
    }
    public int minCameraCover(TreeNode root) {
        // 根节点必须被覆盖
        // return Math.min(process(root).a, process(root).b);   // 这样不行  计算两次
        Info ans = process(root);
        return Math.min(ans.a, ans.b);
    }
    public Info process(TreeNode root){
        if(root == null){
            // 防止溢出+
            return new Info(Integer.MAX_VALUE/2, 0, 0);
        }
        Info left = process(root.left);
        Info right = process(root.right);
        // a：当前节点放相机，子节点取最小值即可
        int a = 1 + Math.min(left.a , Math.min(left.b , left.c)) + Math.min(right.a, Math.min(right.b, right.c));
        // b：当前节点被覆盖但无相机，至少一个子节点有相机
        int b = Math.min(left.a + Math.min(right.a, right.b), right.a + Math.min(left.a, left.b));
        // c：当前节点未被覆盖，子节点都没有相机（否则就被覆盖了） 
        // 子节点只能是 b 状态（自身被覆盖但无相机）
        int c = left.b + right.b;
        return new Info(a, b, c);
    }
}
```
