#### 前序迭代

```java
class Solution {
    public List<Integer> preorderTraversal(TreeNode root) {
        if(root == null)
            return new ArrayList();
        List<Integer> vec = new ArrayList();
        Stack<TreeNode> st = new Stack<>();
        st.push(root);
        while(!st.empty()){
            TreeNode cur = st.pop();
            vec.add(cur.val);
            if(cur.right != null)
                st.push(cur.right);
            if(cur.left != null)
                st.push(cur.left);
        }
        return vec;
